					<description><![CDATA[Featured in exclusively Philite compliant monofilament mesh, double-layer composite filter media, 5-1,200 micron range, absolute rating, change-out differential pressure 0.10 MPa, Max.0.16 MPa and typical applicated on Auto coating &#38; paint, water purification &#38; processing, Pharmaceutical and Food &#38; Beverage area.
Customization accepted.]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<h3>The main advantages of the PE mesh</h3>
<p>1.Stronger tension than an ordinary PE<br />
2.At high tension, it is possible to obtain a relatively small screen extending<br />
3.Screen pulled under high tension, the tension can remain stable for a long time</p>
